{"id":"f2b38185a2de70a2","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-zfc-filter2-cofinite-filter.md","title":"ZFC Filter2 Cofinite Filter","display":"df-zfc-filter2-cofinite-filter — ZFC Filter2 Cofinite Filter","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-filter2-cofinite-filter","aliases":["58-df-zfc-filter2-cofinite-filter","58-df-zfc-filter6-cofinite-filter","58-df-zfc-filter6-frechet-filter"],"display":"df-zfc-filter2-cofinite-filter — ZFC Filter2 Cofinite Filter","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-filter]]","[[58-df-infinite]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-filter2-cofinite-filter"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-filter2-cofinite-filter</span><span>58-df-zfc-filter6-cofinite-filter</span><span>58-df-zfc-filter6-frechet-filter</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-filter2-cofinite-filter — ZFC Filter2 Cofinite Filter"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1331244a5201bb99\" href=\"?note=1331244a5201bb99\" title=\"58-df-filter\">58-df-filter</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"be9675f035d2c1e2\" href=\"?note=be9675f035d2c1e2\" title=\"58-df-infinite\">58-df-infinite</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F,X\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal F,X\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Infinite}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Infinite}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"be9675f035d2c1e2\" href=\"?note=be9675f035d2c1e2\" title=\"58-df-infinite\">58-df-infinite</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Filter}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Filter}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1331244a5201bb99\" href=\"?note=1331244a5201bb99\" title=\"58-df-filter\">58-df-filter</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter2CofiniteFilter}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFilter2CofiniteFilter}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter6CofiniteFilter}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFilter6CofiniteFilter}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (alias predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter6FrechetFilter}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFilter6FrechetFilter}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (alias predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter2\\text{-}cofinite\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter2CofiniteFilter}_S(\\mathcal F,X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Infinite}_S(X)\\land \\mathrm{Filter}_S(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal P(X),\\subseteq)\\land \\mathcal F=\\{A\\subseteq X:|X\\setminus A|\\in\\omega\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter2\\text{-}cofinite\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter2CofiniteFilter}_S(\\mathcal F,X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Infinite}_S(X)\\land \\mathrm{Filter}_S(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal P(X),\\subseteq)\\land \\mathcal F=\\{A\\subseteq X:|X\\setminus A|\\in\\omega\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter6\\text{-}cofinite\\text{-}filter\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter6CofiniteFilter}_S(X,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcFilter2CofiniteFilter}_S(\\mathcal F,X)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter6\\text{-}cofinite\\text{-}filter\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter6CofiniteFilter}_S(X,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcFilter2CofiniteFilter}_S(\\mathcal F,X)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter6\\text{-}frechet\\text{-}filter\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter6FrechetFilter}_S(X,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcFilter2CofiniteFilter}_S(\\mathcal F,X)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter6\\text{-}frechet\\text{-}filter\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter6FrechetFilter}_S(X,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcFilter2CofiniteFilter}_S(\\mathcal F,X)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-filter6-cofinite-filter</code> and <code>58-df-zfc-filter6-frechet-filter</code> are merged here; both defined the cofinite/Frechet filter on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-filter","status":"resolved","id":"1331244a5201bb99","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","lo